                                <i class="fa fa-star"></i><i class="fa fa-star"></i><i class="fa fa-star"></i><i class="fa fa-star"></i><i class="fa fa-star"></i>
                            </div>
                            <p class="text-muted small mb-4 flex-grow-1">
                                "Threadora has produced our premium streetwear hoodies and denim lines for 3 years. Their stitching quality and color accuracy are second to none."
                            </p>
                            <div>
                                <h5 class="fw-bold mb-0">Marcus Vance</h5>
                                <span class="text-muted small">Founder, Vance &amp; Co Apparel (London)</span>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                    </div>

                    <div class="col-lg-4 col-md-6">
                        <div class="p-4 border rounded bg-body h-100 d-flex flex-column">
                            <div class="text-warning mb-3">
                                <i class="fa fa-star"></i><i class="fa fa-star"></i><i class="fa fa-star"></i><i class="fa fa-star"></i><i class="fa fa-star"></i>
                            </div>
                            <p class="text-muted small mb-4 flex-grow-1">
                                "The wholesale ordering process is seamless. They handled our 10,000 unit sportswear run with zero defects and delivered 4 days ahead of schedule."
                            </p>
                            <div>
                                <h5 class="fw-bold mb-0">Elena Rostova</h5>
                                <span class="text-muted small">Head of Sourcing, NordActive (Stockholm)</span>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                    </div>

                    <div class="col-lg-4 col-md-6">
                        <div class="p-4 border rounded bg-body h-100 d-flex flex-column">
                            <div class="text-warning mb-3">
                                <i class="fa fa-star"></i><i class="fa fa-star"></i><i class="fa fa-star"></i><i class="fa fa-star"></i><i class="fa fa-star"></i>
                            </div>
                            <p class="text-muted small mb-4 flex-grow-1">
                                "Their private label custom tag and embroidery work elevated our brand to luxury tier. Exceptional communication and sample prototyping."
                            </p>
                            <div>
                                <h5 class="fw-bold mb-0">Julian Thorne</h5>
                                <span class="text-muted small">Creative Director, Thorne Atelier (New York)</span>
                            </div>
